# Power BI: .pbip projects (TMDL/PBIR) are text and git-friendly and ARE
# committed; these are per-machine local cache/credential artifacts Power BI
# Desktop generates next to them and must never be committed.
**/.pbi/
**/*.pbix
**/CachedData/
**/*.abf
